--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOT A LICENCE CONDITION, BUT PLEASE READ ANYWAY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The dataset is compiled from public reporting. Valuations are last-known marks,
many of them press-reported rather than confirmed, and each row carries a
confidence grade saying so. Entries flagged as state entities, self-funded or
SPAC-announced are NOT priced venture rounds and must not be presented as
though they were.

Nothing here is investment advice. The emergence score has never been
backtested against outcomes; it measures whether something has been repriced,
not whether it will be. See the Limitations section of README.md before drawing
a conclusion from any number in this repository.
